  "notes": "Deliberately thin on high-risk contacts: crisis, counseling, Title IX and conduct contacts are canonical in Agent 3's resources/shared/sensitive-referrals.md and must not be duplicated here. The public Health & Well-being page published no phone, email or after-hours line as retrieved, and ALC staff emails were not readable, so none are asserted. The START Center link returned HTTP 404 on 2026-08-31. sha256 is null for every source. Each page was located and read at its public URL on 2026-08-31, but the network egress available during collection could not re-download raw response bodies for hashing, so no digest is asserted rather than a fabricated one. Agent 5 owns hashing via tools/fetch_sources.py; digests must be populated by that pipeline (or an equivalent unrestricted re-fetch) before this sidecar can pass a schema that requires 64 hex characters. retrieved_at reflects the collection session on 2026-08-31."
